## Article 3. Basic Terms

```catala
declaration scope Article3AppealClassification:
  input appealType content AppealType
  input appealForm content AppealForm
  input containsSubstance content YesNo
  input requestsRecognition content YesNo
  input requestsRightsRestoration content YesNo
  input violationActions content YesNo
  input violationDecisions content YesNo
  input violationInaction content YesNo
  output isProposal content YesNo
  output isApplication content YesNo
  output isComplaint content YesNo
  output isComplaintRecognized content YesNo
  output classificationValid content YesNo

scope Article3AppealClassification:
  label proposal_defined exception proposal_default
  definition isProposal under condition
    appealType = Proposal
    consequence equals Yes

  label proposal_default definition isProposal equals No

  label application_defined exception application_default
  definition isApplication under condition
    appealType = Application and requestsRecognition = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label complaint_application exception application_default
  definition isApplication under condition
    appealType = Application and requestsRecognition = Yes
    consequence equals No

  label application_default definition isApplication equals No

  label complaint_recognized_default definition isComplaintRecognized equals No

  label complaint_recognized exception complaint_recognized_default
  definition isComplaintRecognized under condition
    appealType = Complaint and (violationActions = Yes or violationDecisions = Yes or violationInaction = Yes)
    consequence equals Yes

  label is_complaint exception complaint_default
  definition isComplaint under condition
    isComplaintRecognized = Yes or (appealType = Application and requestsRecognition = Yes)
    consequence equals Yes

  label complaint_default definition isComplaint equals No

  label classification_valid exception classification_default
  definition classificationValid under condition
    (isProposal = Yes or isApplication = Yes or isComplaint = Yes)
    and not (isProposal = Yes and isApplication = Yes)
    and not (isProposal = Yes and isComplaint = Yes)
    and not (isApplication = Yes and isComplaint = Yes)
    consequence equals Yes

  label classification_default definition classificationValid equals No
```

## Article 4. Decisions, actions (inaction) that may be appealed

```catala
declaration scope Article4AppealableActions:
  input subject content ComplaintSubject
  output isAppealable content YesNo

scope Article4AppealableActions:
  label rights_violated exception not_appealable_default
  definition isAppealable under condition
    subject.rightsViolated = Yes or subject.freedomsViolated = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label unlawful_obligations exception not_appealable_default
  definition isAppealable under condition
    subject.unlawfulObligations = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label unlawful_responsibility exception not_appealable_default
  definition isAppealable under condition
    subject.unlawfulResponsibility = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label obstacles exception not_appealable_default
  definition isAppealable under condition
    subject.rightsViolated = Yes or subject.freedomsViolated = Yes or subject.unlawfulObligations = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_appealable_default definition isAppealable equals No
```